  "description": "Provides enterprise-grade logging capabilities for TuanZi applications through NLog integration, including:\n\t\t\t- High-performance structured logging\n\t\t\t- Flexible target configurations (file, database, cloud, etc.)\n\t\t\t- Advanced log routing and filtering rules\n\t\t\t- Contextual logging with MDC/NDC support\n\t\t\t- Log event enrichment capabilities\n\t\t\t- Async logging with configurable buffers\n\t\t\t- Automatic log file archiving and retention\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi diagnostic systems",
